    <h3>9.3 Duty Lifecycle State Machine Diagram</h3>
    <p>
      Models the progression of a duty assignment from initial administrative scheduling to final verification:
    </p>
    <div style="text-align:center; margin:16px 0 24px 0;">
    <img src="figure_9_3_state_machine.png" alt="Figure 9.3: State Machine Diagram - Duty Lifecycle" style="max-width:100%; height:auto; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; border-radius:6px; box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);" />
